{"work_id":"manohara","scene_id":"manohara-s013","scene_ordinal":13,"transition_audit_id":"T013","source_scene_number":null,"source_scene_file":"works/manohara/scenes/scene-013.md","record_count":13,"records":[{"id":"manohara-s013-d001","scene_id":"manohara-s013","scene_ordinal":13,"transition_audit_id":"T013","speaker_label":"சிப்பாய் 1","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அரசே! ஆபத்து...ஆபத்து...மதில்களுக்கு நாசம்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":26,"printed_page":25}],"source_scene_file":"scene-013.md"},{"id":"manohara-s013-d002","scene_id":"manohara-s013","scene_ordinal":13,"transition_audit_id":"T013","speaker_label":"சிப்பாய் 2","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"பூரண கும்பம் முறிந்தது.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":26,"printed_page":25}],"source_scene_file":"scene-013.md"},{"id":"manohara-s013-d003","scene_id":"manohara-s013","scene_ordinal":13,"transition_audit_id":"T013","speaker_label":"சிப்பாய் 3","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"எதிரிகள் முன்னேறுகிறார்கள்.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":27,"printed_page":26}],"source_scene_file":"scene-013.md"},{"id":"manohara-s013-d004","scene_id":"manohara-s013","scene_ordinal":13,"transition_audit_id":"T013","speaker_label":"விஜயா","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"அப்பா! இந்த ரத்ன சிம்மாசனத்துக்காக இவ்வளவு ரத்தமா ஓடவேண்டும்?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":27,"printed_page":26}],"source_scene_file":"scene-013.md"},{"id":"manohara-s013-d005","scene_id":"manohara-s013","scene_ordinal":13,"transition_audit_id":"T013","speaker_label":"முத்து விஜயன்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ரத்தம்...ரத்தம் எனக்கு நீச்சல் குளம். யுத்தம் எனக்கு ஒரு பொழுது போக்கு! இதையறியாமல் மோதுகிறான் இந்த முத்து விஜயனிடம், மூர்க்கன்!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":27,"printed_page":26}],"source_scene_file":"scene-013.md"},{"id":"manohara-s013-d006","scene_id":"manohara-s013","scene_ordinal":13,"transition_audit_id":"T013","speaker_label":"சிப்பாய்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆபத்து! ஆபத்து! அணிகள் சிதறிவிட்டன","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":27,"printed_page":26}],"source_scene_file":"scene-013.md"},{"id":"manohara-s013-d007","scene_id":"manohara-s013","scene_ordinal":13,"transition_audit_id":"T013","speaker_label":"மு. வி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"எங்கே சேனாதிபதி? எங்கே அந்த சிங்கநெஞ்சன்?","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":27,"printed_page":26}],"source_scene_file":"scene-013.md"},{"id":"manohara-s013-d008","scene_id":"manohara-s013","scene_ordinal":13,"transition_audit_id":"T013","speaker_label":"சிப்பாய்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"புகழுடம்பு பெற்றுவிட்டார், வேந்தே! போர்க்களத்தில் மடிந்துவிட்டார்,","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":27,"printed_page":26}],"source_scene_file":"scene-013.md"},{"id":"manohara-s013-d009","scene_id":"manohara-s013","scene_ordinal":13,"transition_audit_id":"T013","speaker_label":"சிப்பாய் 2","speaker_delimiter":"-","text":"மீன் கொடி சாய்ந்துவிட்டது.","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":27,"printed_page":26}],"source_scene_file":"scene-013.md"},{"id":"manohara-s013-d010","scene_id":"manohara-s013","scene_ordinal":13,"transition_audit_id":"T013","speaker_label":"மு. வி","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"ஆ!...இதோ புறப்பட்டு விட்டேன்...எங்கே என் படைகள்...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":27,"printed_page":26}],"source_scene_file":"scene-013.md"},{"id":"manohara-s013-d011","scene_id":"manohara-s013","scene_ordinal":13,"transition_audit_id":"T013","speaker_label":"முத்து","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"வாடா தம்பி!...\nவாள் பிடிக்கத் தெரியாத வாலிபனே! வளைத்துவிட்டோம் கோட்டையை என்று எண்ணிவிடாதே","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":27,"printed_page":26}],"source_scene_file":"scene-013.md"},{"id":"manohara-s013-d012","scene_id":"manohara-s013","scene_ordinal":13,"transition_audit_id":"T013","speaker_label":"மனோகரன்","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"கேள்விப்பட்டிருக்கிறேன்- நீர் வீரர்...வாய் வீச்சிலே என்று!","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":27,"printed_page":26}],"source_scene_file":"scene-013.md"},{"id":"manohara-s013-d013","scene_id":"manohara-s013","scene_ordinal":13,"transition_audit_id":"T013","speaker_label":"முத்து","speaker_delimiter":":","text":"வாள் வீச்சிலும் கூடத்தான்!...","page_provenance":[{"pdf_page":27,"printed_page":26}],"source_scene_file":"scene-013.md"}]}